    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>}<br />Putting&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>, we get,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mtext>tan</mtext><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mtext>tan</mtext><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>26</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mtext>&#960;</mtext><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>26</mn></math>",
